      " Sukses: Berhasil memuat data asli '../data/clean/pull_requests_clean.csv'.\n",
      " Info Sampel: Ditemukan 1124 data User dan 176 data Bot.\n",
      "\n",
      "=======================================================\n",
      "   HASIL OUTPUT PENGUJIAN Z-TEST (USER VS BOT VIA PR)   \n",
      "=======================================================\n",
      "User (Populasi 1) -> Rata-rata Merge: 0.8986, Sampel (n1): 1124\n",
      "Bot  (Populasi 2) -> Rata-rata Merge: 0.7045, Sampel (n2): 176\n",
      "-------------------------------------------------------\n",
      "Z-Statistic Value : 5.4433\n",
      "P-Value Result    : 0.0000\n",
      "Statistical Dec   : reject H0\n",
      "=======================================================\n"
     ]
